# Public REST API test requests (Group Project).
# Open this file in Visual Studio 2022/2026 or VS Code (REST Client extension)
# while the app is running, and click "Send Request" above each request.

@host = https://localhost:7050
@key = stacks-demo-key-2026

### 1. Service status
GET {{host}}/api/v1/status
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 2. Search the catalogue
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalogue?search=hobbit
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 3. Available items at one branch, page 1
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalogue?branch=CAS&availableOnly=true&page=1&pageSize=10
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 4. One item by library code
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalogue/BK-0001
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 5. Categories
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 6. All branches and whether they're open now
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 7. One branch's operating status
GET {{host}}/api/v1/branches/PAL/status
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 8. EXPECT 401 - no API key
GET {{host}}/api/v1/status

### 9. EXPECT 400 - invalid type
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalogue?type=Video
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 10. EXPECT 404 - unknown item
GET {{host}}/api/v1/catalogue/NOPE-0000
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### 11. EXPECT 405 - the API is read-only
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/catalogue/BK-0001
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
